{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cheapskate is a third person, free form, skateboarding game inspired by retro and modern action sports games. Skateboard in unique locations tailored for exploration and execution of creative skateboard lines and tricks across flowing skateboard obstacles and level designs. Experiment with tricks and lines at your own pace. The philosophy behind the game is to give you freedom to skate, freedom to learn, and freedom to challenge yourself and friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is meant to offer something familiar to retro and modern action sports game fans, but also be forgiving to new players to the genre. Easy to play, inspiring to master is our goal. The game features precise, digital inputs and predictable, snappy, arcade physics to help you skate consistently. Nothing is governed by unpredictable, overly realistic physics simulations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supports:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >completely offline single player</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play anytime you want, anywhere you are, with no required internet connection</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >account free multi player</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >host a game, share a host code with friends and they can join</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who made it:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >passion project</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >micro, indie team</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for looking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO GENERATIVE AI WAS USED TO CREATE THIS GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554520/extras/f2af147e2eeb94437bc914af9fc59220.avif?t=1747093950\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554520?t=1747093950","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554520/1d33e3443d5f151abd013ca5f66f3479f265ad91/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747093950","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554520/ae01d49d572fd5a359a833fa3a0ca3509b51c522/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747093950","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554520/ae01d49d572fd5a359a833fa3a0ca3509b51c522/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747093950","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cheapskate is a third person, free form, skateboarding game inspired by retro and modern action sports games. Skateboard in unique locations tailored for exploration and execution of creative skateboard lines and tricks across flowing skateboard obstacles and level designs. Experiment with tricks and lines at your own pace. The philosophy behind the game is to give you freedom to skate, freedom to learn, and freedom to challenge yourself and friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is meant to offer something familiar to retro and modern action sports game fans, but also be forgiving to n